    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fee0e81519139e4f2289a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>小米14Ultra刚发布，我们两个人一个激情下单小米14Ultra，另一个人却转头买了小米14？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 小米14Ultra半个多月的影像初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 我真的很爱四等深微曲屏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 四代Ultra拍的照片有什么不同？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> 小米的人像抠图……不行从OPPO挖个人吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 为什么小米14Ultra刚出我却买了小米14？</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于样张对比，我改主意了，因为太细了，我过两天视频出了直接把链接贴上来好了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里就放几张我俩比较喜欢的照片：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小米14</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgQS_c6ECnsCAziX_U2kOm6AyUU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu35Ipyiei0-VRVEd39mQGey0w6O.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小米14Ultra</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpkppp4chPyvY8KJm-L-IOzH_oEm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvn6KW7fH9jeY8FNawMTOoxGzaGA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnwyFStKdDikCcRoDzQBwa3ElX-p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lth1MS-OgiuB4k2KiTcw8KOj8tXf.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
